RSIAgent (independent reimplementation)
Copyright 2026

This product is an independent reimplementation of the framework described in:

    Sibo Zhu, Shicheng Fan, Xinyue Wang, Wenyi Wu, Kun Zhou, Biwei Huang.
    "RSIAgent: Autonomous Exploration for Recursive Self-improvement in New
    Environments." arXiv:2609.15364, 2026.
    https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.15364

It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or derived from the source code of the
original authors' implementation. Short passages of the paper are quoted in
docstrings and prompt templates for traceability, with attribution.

The repository also refers to third-party benchmarks and systems by name
(OSWorld, Agents' Last Exam, GameCraft-Bench, Play2Code). No third-party code
or benchmark assets are bundled here.
